2.7 Lemma 2.7.15"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"54–55"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>75</span><span>76</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"原书OCR文本陈述已逐项比对；证明核验范围见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span> 和规则集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a>；这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,V\">\\(F,V\\)</span> 分别实例化上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R\">\\(\\to_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"55c39f44acb2211c\" href=\"?note=55c39f44acb2211c\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-relation\">56-df-rewrite-relation</a>。</li>\n<li>CP、局部合流、可汇合见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4176ebfcf797c869\" href=\"?note=4176ebfcf797c869\" title=\"56-df-critical-pair\">56-df-critical-pair</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"766a1d5bf25248d1\" href=\"?note=766a1d5bf25248d1\" title=\"56-df-locally-confluent\">56-df-locally-confluent</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"1de67f45113d6dcf\" href=\"?note=1de67f45113d6dcf\" title=\"56-df-joinable\">56-df-joinable</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocallyConfluent}(T,\\to_R)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall(s,t)\\in\\mathrm{CP}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\;\\mathrm{Join}(T,\\to_R,s,t).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LocallyConfluent}(T,\\to_R)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\forall(s,t)\\in\\mathrm{CP}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\;\\mathrm{Join}(T,\\to_R,s,t).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已核对原书陈述和三类峰证明：分离红项可交换；变量内嵌套时对被复制的变量出现依次归约，再同步替换，无需左线性；非平凡重叠由临界对实例及重写的上下文/替换封闭性汇合。因此本引理适用于一般一阶TRS，不额外要求左线性或终止性。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-critical-pair","status":"resolved","id":"4176ebfcf797c869","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-critical-pair]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-locally-confluent","status":"resolved","id":"766a1d5bf25248d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-locally-confluent]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-joinable","status":"resolved","id":"1de67f45113d6dcf","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-joinable]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-relation","status":"resolved","id":"55c39f44acb2211c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-rewrite-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-rewrite-system","status":"resolved","id":"a6c29a8d098ef0ed","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})$、$V$、$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma